  "id": "restore-signout",
  "description": "Sign-out and the restore key (WIRE-CONTRACT-V5 §12.3 rule 5, §12.11.8). Device A is signed in and its backup item is shared with the person's device B, so the item holds B's key id. A's check with B's id is not current for A (a key of another device never is): a new key is minted (201) and replaces A's own. A signs out; the Worker deletes A's key in the same request, so A's secret is refused afterwards (400 invalid_grant), and a signed-out device cannot enrol (403 account_required). B's key is B's own and is not touched.",
